mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Slow[Page feels slow] --> Q1{How many rows and columns in the DOM?}
  Q1 -->|Thousands| Page[Page or infinite-scroll; drop columns]
  Q1 -->|Small| Q2{Are you refetching in a timer?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Stop[Stop polling refreshApex]
  Q2 -->|No| Q3{Fat adapter or extra fields?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Least[Narrow the wire or Apex DTO]
  Q3 -->|No| Q4{Config changed in renderedCallback?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| Loop[Move config updates out of renderedCallback]
  Q4 -->|No| Edit[Reduce inline-edit columns and custom cell types]
